# Rule Placement and Categorisation

## Layout

| Category | Path | Use for |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Agent / workflow | `.cursor/rules/agent/<slug>.mdc` | Lifecycle, SDD/ADR/PR, doc-sync, reports |
| Language | `.cursor/rules/language/<slug>.mdc` | Language idioms not tied to one framework |
| Framework / runtime | `.cursor/rules/<framework-slug>/<slug>.mdc` | e.g. `spring-boot/` |

Prefer the most specific category that still applies broadly. Extend existing files before adding new ones.
